flowchart LR
    Start([Start]) --> Capture[Capture problems encountered during the cycle]
    Capture --> Aggregate@{ shape: collate, label: "Aggregate problems since last I&A cycle" }
    Aggregate --> Suggest[Suggest solutions]
    Suggest --> Decision{What should happen?}

    Decision -- Solve in agent --> Solve[Solve in agent]
    Decision -- Alert the human --> Alert[Alert the human]
    Decision -- Take no action --> NoAction[Take no action]

    Solve --> End([End])
    Alert --> End
    NoAction --> End
